        "Eli Yablonovitch",
        "John D. Joannopoulos",
        "Sajeev John"
      ],
      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Photonic crystals and band gaps established a powerful way to control light through periodic structures and influenced optics, materials design, and device research.",
        "attribution": "The credited theorists and experimental pioneer represent complementary contributions, but the conceptual origins and independent early demonstrations require a precise priority account.",
        "maturity": "The field has had decades to mature, with confirmed physical principles and a wide range of implementations.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The exact division of priority among early theoretical proposals and experimental demonstrations."
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
